WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.600
an estimated 624,000 migrants journeying into the United States.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:07.240
Think of that.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.320
The U.N. is supporting people

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:11.640
that are illegally coming into the United States,

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:12.800
and then we have to get them out.

